{"alias":"/learning/II/ConCEPT/connections","title":"Community Connections","changed":"2026-04-06T22:49:43+00:00","before":"<p><img alt=\"Community Connections Banner\" data-entity-type=\"file\" data-entity-uuid=\"961e23a3-bfd1-4bc1-a3de-260e3a576b0a\" src=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-images/Interdisciplinary%20Instruction%20-%20Community%20Connections%20Banner%20-%206.10.2025.png\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; display:block;\"></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Community connections can make learning more relevant and meaningful by helping to foster a sense of belonging, develop empathy, and link classroom experiences to the real world.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The video below explores ideas on how educators can discover connections to the community and prepare community members and students for a successful experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-12 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary mb-3\"><strong>Community Connections</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-7\"><iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen=\"\" frameborder=\"0\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Vm9-JIsKp_c?si=XgE6_nhxCHoI67Gd\" style=\"width:100%;; height:315px;\" title=\"Community Connections\"></iframe></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-5\">\r\n<p><strong>Planning Resources</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/14uo8WJoR3E6MDUY9ZJTWgcgDT_V_ZfbL70Aujg060A0/copy\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Community Connection Inventory</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1rNwm7Ouzo4yeJDPgXL0oxITLEZ0ntNFT_3rwmFuwQHU/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Community Connections Slide Deck</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1D2w8UOSbn3WUBPQOqhxayK0WeCkmR1KjgSXyaPKJb60/edit?usp=sharing\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Preparing for a Community Member Visit</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p><br>\r\n<strong>Further Reading</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.nea.org/sites/default/files/2021-01/NEA%20Calendar%20%281%29.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">95 Ways to Engage Students Through the Community</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://blog.fundly.com/community-service-ideas/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">145 Community Service Ideas</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.edutopia.org/practice/community-partners-making-student-learning-relevant\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Bringing the Community into the Classroom</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.edutopia.org/article/engaging-students-community-based-projects\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Engaging Students with Community-Based Practices</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.edutopia.org/blog/school-community-collaboration-brendan-okeefe\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">5 Steps to Better School/Community Collaboration</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n","after":"<div class=\"doe-hero\">\n<p class=\"doe-lead\">Community connections can make learning more relevant and meaningful by helping to foster a sense of belonging, develop empathy, and link classroom experiences to the real world.</p>\n\n</div>\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>The video below explores ideas on how educators can discover connections to the community and prepare community members and students for a successful experience.</p>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-12 py-2\">\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"car